# =============================================================
# DTWS Monorepo — Environment pointers
# The public website and private Optimus app each have their own
# env template. Copy the relevant file to `.env.local` inside the
# app folder, e.g.:
#   website/.env.local    — for the public site
#   optimus/.env.local    — for the private Optimus portal
# NEVER commit the `.env.local` files or any secret values.
# =============================================================

# ---------------- Deployment pointers ----------------
# (Optional) Used by root scripts; the per-app templates repeat
# these NEXT_PUBLIC_* variables.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://demitechwebservices.live
# NEXT_PUBLIC_OPTIMUS_URL=https://optimus.demitechwebservices.live

# See:
#   website/.env.example    — public-facing variables only
#   optimus/.env.example    — all private secrets + shared public vars
